<title>USA: Centex Construction sees record yr results.</title>
<headline>Centex Construction sees record yr results.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centex Construction Products Inc said it expects to report record results for the full fiscal year ending March 1997.</p>
<p>The company today reported third quarter earnings of $11.2 million or $0.51 per share, up from $10.0 million or $0.43 per share last year.</p>
<p>It said it expects high demand for cement, gypsum wallboard and concrete and aggregates products to continue to support strong pricing in its markets.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
